Third-party components
======================

The shipped programs (ContextCompanion.Core, ContextCompanion.App,
ContextCompanion.Platform.Windows and the `ccomp` tool) use the .NET 10
runtime and the Windows Desktop runtime (WPF, and Windows Forms for the tray
icon), both MIT licensed by the .NET Foundation and Microsoft, and one package:

DPAPI (ContextCompanion.Platform.Windows, and the Windows build of `ccomp`):
  System.Security.Cryptography.ProtectedData 10.0.0
  Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
  Licence: MIT
  https://github.com/dotnet/runtime

ContextCompanion.Core takes no package dependencies.

The test projects (tests/ContextCompanion.Core.Tests and
tests/ContextCompanion.Platform.Windows.Tests) use the following packages at
build and test time only; none of them is shipped:

Test framework: xUnit.net v2
  xunit 2.9.3, xunit.core, xunit.assert, xunit.abstractions 2.0.3,
  xunit.extensibility.core, xunit.extensibility.execution,
  xunit.analyzers 1.18.0, xunit.runner.visualstudio 3.1.4
  Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/xunit/xunit

Test host: Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk 17.14.1 and its dependencies
  Microsoft.TestPlatform.TestHost, Microsoft.TestPlatform.ObjectModel,
  Microsoft.CodeCoverage 17.14.1
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
  Licence: MIT
